WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.104
This is what happens when the fire alarm sounds. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:07.104 --> 00:00:12.552
The alarm makes a very loud sound: whoop, whoop, whoop.

3
00:00:12.552 --> 00:00:19.224
The sound is not dangerous. It means: walk outside now.

4
00:00:19.224 --> 00:00:24.048
Everyone stops what they are doing and stands up calmly.

5
00:00:24.048 --> 00:00:30.336
We walk to the exit with everyone. No running is needed.

6
00:00:30.336 --> 00:00:35.016
We stand at the meeting point with our class or group.

7
00:00:35.016 --> 00:00:38.856
The teacher or leader counts everyone.

8
00:00:38.856 --> 00:00:44.496
When it is safe, the alarm stops, and we go back inside.

9
00:00:44.496 --> 00:00:52.704
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

